    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d840">

                <pb facs="0780" n="608" sameAs="frus:frus1917Supp01v01/pg608"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 701.6232/10</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Ambassador in Brazil</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Morgan</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-06-06T13:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">June 6, 1917, 1 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Your June 5, 11 a.m. Ambassador at Buenos Aires has issued safe-conduct to
                    following: Pauli and Danner, valet; Willdolt, attaché; Grunon, chancellor;
                    Munzenthaler, Consul General; Steinfiegel and Pfaff, consuls; Markmann,
                    secretary and wife.</p>
                <p>You may issue following safe-conduct to balance of official party embarking at
                    Rio de Janeiro. Also similar safe-conduct may be issued to late German Minister
                    to Bolivia.</p>
                <p>[Here follows form of safe-conduct printed in telegram of June 2 to the
                    Ambassador in Argentine, above.]</p>
                <pb facs="0781" n="609" xml:id="pg609"/>
                <p>The right of search is reserved by the United States authorities.</p>
                <p>Please inform Department for what reason <hi rendition="#italic">Frisia</hi> is
                    touching at New York <hi rendition="#italic">en route</hi> to Halifax and how
                    long she is expected to stay New York.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
